WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.400
- I like your shoes.
- Yeah!

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.200
They are

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.860
three sizes too big but I
wanted them so I got them.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.040
- Oh my gosh I've done
that, I've done that!

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.010
I literally got it, it
was a half size bigger

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.490
but I was like whatever they're so cute.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.510
- It's fine, I'll grow into them.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:14.343
- You probably will,

00:00:14.343 --> 00:00:15.785
you're so tall and only
16, that's awesome.

00:00:15.785 --> 00:00:17.280
- Right thank you, it's a good thing.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.550
- It's so cool. So why
are bows your thing?

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:20.490
They were my thing too

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.000
because I was in dance
and all that growing up.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.120
- For sure, that's
actually how they started

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.070
for me you know.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.860
When I was little my mom,
I mean I was two years old,

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:28.693
when I was born actually,

00:00:28.693 --> 00:00:30.300
my mom just kind of stuck them in my hair,

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.090
and my joke is, as I got older,

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.146
my bows just kept on getting bigger.

00:00:35.146 --> 00:00:36.857
(laughing)

00:00:36.857 --> 00:00:39.350
But as I realize that bows are really like

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:40.620
a part of my life,

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.620
I realized that I wanted
them to mean something.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.540
And so, what I came up
with is Siwa-nators.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.420
And so if you're wearing a bow,

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:49.980
or you see someone wearing a bow,

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:52.120
that means that they are a Siwa-nator.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.850
So say you're, you know, at school,

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.400
or you don't have anyone
to play with at recess,

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.040
or you don't have anyone
to sit at lunch with.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:00.873
- Yeah.

00:01:00.873 --> 00:01:03.090
- If you see someone wearing a JoJo Bow,

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.980
you know that you can sit with them,

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:07.550
or you know you can play with
them because that person--

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:08.383
- It's a safe place.

00:01:08.383 --> 00:01:10.431
- It's a safe place, that
person will be nice to you.

00:01:10.431 --> 00:01:11.635
(applauding)

00:01:11.635 --> 00:01:12.468
- That's so cool!

00:01:12.468 --> 00:01:13.676
- That person will be kind to you.

00:01:13.676 --> 00:01:16.350
Yeah! I actually,

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:17.640
if you two are up for it,

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:20.188
I might have a little
present for you guys.

00:01:20.188 --> 00:01:21.533
- I am up for it.

00:01:21.533 --> 00:01:23.763
(cheering)

00:01:23.763 --> 00:01:24.693
Jason!

00:01:24.693 --> 00:01:27.660
- I brought you a bright bow
with lots of rhinestones.

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:28.640
- I love that it's yellow too,

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:29.970
because sunflowers are my favorite flower.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:31.853
- Well there you go.
- Oh my gosh! I'm so into it.

00:01:31.853 --> 00:01:34.279
And Jason! I had to bring you a denim bow.

00:01:34.279 --> 00:01:36.111
- Hey denim's my favorite color

00:01:36.111 --> 00:01:38.528
(applauding)

00:01:39.381 --> 00:01:42.853
- I love it!

00:01:44.251 --> 00:01:46.670
- You got the back
showing the front, okay.

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:48.290
- My bad.
- There you go!

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:50.800
- I'm just letting you know,

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.350
that's a real man that's letting
you touch his cowboy hat.

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:55.140
- Is it? I don't know about that.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:56.913
- You can sit with me at lunch, it's fine.

00:01:56.913 --> 00:01:58.371
- You can sit with me at lunch.

